---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="World Explorer" description="Trails walked, peaks reached, silences found.">

  <!-- ── HERO ── -->
  <div class="hero-wrap">
    <div class="hero-photo-col">
      <img src="/images/explorer-profile.jpg" alt="Giselle at a mountain hut in the Swiss Alps" class="hero-photo" />
    </div>
    <div class="hero-text-col">
      <p class="intro-p">I grew up in Yunnan, China, a mountainous region where nature was never far away. It shaped my personality, and being outdoors has never felt like an activity to me. Nature is my best friend.</p>
      <p class="intro-bold">Nature never judges.</p>
      <div class="intro-trio">
        <p>Nature respects you as long as you respect it.</p>
        <p>Nature calls for the bravest heart and brutal honesty.</p>
        <p>Nature always shares the most breathtaking beauty and the most touching moments.</p>
      </div>
      <p class="intro-p">Nature has no preferences, so it simply stays true to what it is. Over time, that became a part of me. I prefer curiosity over certainty, understanding over judgment, and self-honesty over sugarcoating.</p>
      <p class="intro-p">I usually describe myself as an <strong class="text-blue">ONTP</strong>.</p>
      <p class="intro-p">I gain energy outdoors. Some of my favorite days begin before sunrise, with a train ride toward the mountains and no particular urgency beyond seeing where the trail leads.</p>
      <p class="intro-p">Curiosity has pulled me in many unexpected directions. Over the years, it has led me to languages, musical instruments, history, strategy, photography, long conversations, different cities, and even countries.</p>
      <p class="intro-p">This website is simply a collection of things I have done, things I am doing, and things I find interesting, beautiful, or worth exploring: places I have visited, ideas I have encountered, questions I am still thinking about, and whatever happens to catch my eye.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ── BENTO GRID ── -->
  <div class="outer-wrap">

    <!-- 2+3+4+5+6 · BENTO GRID ──────────────────────────── -->
    <div class="bento">

      <!-- MUSIC (full width) -->
      <div class="bento-card bento-music">
        <p class="mod-label">A Life in Sound</p>
        <div class="sound-body">
          <div class="sound-text">
          <p class="sound-p">My relationship with music started before anyone taught me anything. In first grade, my mother brought home a recorder. No instructions came with it. Two or three days later, she found me playing complete melodies. I had figured it out alone.</p>
          <p class="sound-p">In middle school, my mother took me to a teacher from the local orchestra. I asked him which wind instrument was the hardest. He said the clarinet. I chose the clarinet. (I always go for the toughest nut to crack.) The teacher told me that the purpose of learning an instrument is to find an outlet for your soul. A rainy afternoon, a few bars of jazz, just for yourself. Music, he said, will stay with you for life.</p>
          <p class="sound-p">Much later, in Shanghai, I met my pipa teacher. He was nearly eighty, trained under masters, and we were both fans of Suzhou 评弹. At the first lesson, he played a short folk tune, then said: "Imagine you sit down and play a piece just for yourself, with the bright moon outside your window." It brought me back to my old clarinet lessons. I signed up with him, and eventually carried the instrument home by hand. Years later, it came with me all the way to Lucerne.</p>
          </div>
          <figure class="sound-photos">
            <div class="pipa-photos">
              <img src="/images/pipa-luthier.jpg" alt="With the luthier at his workshop, Shanghai 2023" class="pipa-photo">
              <img src="/images/pipa-teacher.jpg" alt="With my pipa teacher at his studio, Shanghai 2023" class="pipa-photo">
            </div>
            <figcaption class="pipa-caption">With the luthier (left) and my teacher (right) · Shanghai 2023</figcaption>
          </figure>
          <div class="instrument-list">
            <div class="instrument-item">
              <img src="/images/instr-recorder.png" alt="Recorder illustration" class="instr-img">
              <div class="instr-text">
                <span class="instr-zh">竖笛</span>
                <span class="instr-en">Recorder</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="instrument-item">
              <img src="/images/instr-clarinet.png" alt="Clarinet illustration" class="instr-img">
              <div class="instr-text">
                <span class="instr-zh">单簧管</span>
                <span class="instr-en">Clarinet</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="instrument-item">
              <img src="/images/instr-hulusheng.png" alt="Hulusheng illustration" class="instr-img">
              <div class="instr-text">
                <span class="instr-zh">葫芦笙</span>
                <span class="instr-en">Hulusheng</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="instrument-item">
              <img src="/images/instr-pipa.png" alt="Pipa illustration" class="instr-img">
              <div class="instr-text">
                <span class="instr-zh">琵琶</span>
                <span class="instr-en">Pipa</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- ── Hike CTA ── -->
      <a href="/trails" class="hike-cta">
        <img src="/images/hike-invite.jpg" alt="Hiking in the Swiss Alps" class="hike-cta-bg" />
        <div class="hike-cta-content">
          <p class="hike-cta-title">Come hiking with me</p>
          <span class="hike-cta-btn">Explore the trails →</span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <!-- CATS (full width) -->
      <div class="bento-card bento-cats">
        <p class="mod-label">The Bosses at Home</p>
        <div class="cats-wrap">

          <div class="cat-card">
            <div class="cat-photo-wrap">
              <img src="/images/cat-first.jpg" alt="嘞嘞 Leilei" class="cat-photo" />
            </div>
            <div class="cat-info">
              <div class="cat-meta">
                <span class="cat-gender">♂</span>
                <span class="cat-since">Since 2016</span>
              </div>
              <p class="cat-name">嘞嘞 <span class="cat-name-en">Leilei</span></p>
              <div class="cat-story">
                <p>When he first came home, he refused all invitations to join the rest of the family. Then I discovered something interesting. Whenever I called out "Leilei…", he would cautiously peek out from his hiding spot. I felt it would be disrespectful not to accept his decision.</p>
                <p>So I named him Leilei. Or more accurately, he named himself.</p>
                <p>He is a British Shorthair Silver Shaded with perfectly outlined eyes. He is calm, observant, and not particularly interested in unnecessary excitement. Most of the time, he prefers to watch the world rather than participate in it.</p>
                <p>My father taught him how to shake hands. Surprisingly, he learned quickly. Even more surprisingly, if asked for a specific paw, he usually offers the correct one.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="cats-divider"></div>

          <div class="cat-card cat-card--reverse">
            <div class="cat-photo-wrap">
              <img src="/images/cat-second.jpg" alt="小咪渣 Xiao Mi Zha" class="cat-photo" />
            </div>
            <div class="cat-info">
              <div class="cat-meta">
                <span class="cat-gender">♀</span>
                <span class="cat-since">Since 2019</span>
              </div>
              <p class="cat-name">小咪渣 <span class="cat-name-en">Xiao Mi Zha</span></p>
              <div class="cat-story">
                <p>Xiao Mi Zha is a Yunnan dialect nickname. She is an American Shorthair tabby with endless energy, a remarkable appetite, and absolutely no respect for personal space.</p>
                <p>She has a special talent for "hanging" on people. If a human is available, she would like to be attached to them.</p>
                <p>Despite being the smaller one, she produces surprisingly powerful snores. After a successful day of eating, cuddling, and supervising humans, she can often be found sleeping peacefully while sounding much larger than she actually is.</p>
                <p>Her favorite foods are durian, fresh prawns, and beef jerky.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>

    </div><!-- /bento -->

  </div><!-- /outer-wrap -->

</BaseLayout>

<style>
  /* ── Hero ── */
  .hero-wrap {
    max-width: 1600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 64px clamp(20px, 5vw, 80px) 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 520px 1fr;
    gap: 56px;
    align-items: stretch;
  }
  .hero-photo-col {
    width: 520px;
    min-height: 480px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    -webkit-mask-image:
      linear-gradient(to right,  transparent 0%, black 5%, black 95%, transparent 100%),
      linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent 0%, black 5%, black 95%, transparent 100%);
    -webkit-mask-composite: destination-in;
    mask-image:
      linear-gradient(to right,  transparent 0%, black 5%, black 95%, transparent 100%),
      linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent 0%, black 5%, black 95%, transparent 100%);
    mask-composite: intersect;
  }
  .hero-photo {
    width: 100%; height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: 75% 40%;
    display: block;
  }
  .hero-text-col {
    padding-bottom: 12px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 14px;
  }
  .intro-p {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: clamp(18px, 1.65vw, 22px);
    font-weight: 300; font-style: italic;
    line-height: 1.8; color: var(--ink);
    margin: 0;
  }
  .intro-p strong {
    font-weight: 600; font-style: normal;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .intro-p strong.text-blue {
    color: #4a7fc1;
  }
  .intro-bold {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: clamp(21px, 2vw, 27px);
    font-weight: 600; font-style: italic;
    color: var(--rose);
    margin: 4px 0;
  }
  .intro-trio {
    border-left: 2px solid rgba(193,125,157,0.35);
    padding-left: 20px;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px;
  }
  .intro-trio p {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: clamp(17px, 1.55vw, 21px);
    font-weight: 300; font-style: italic;
    line-height: 1.65; color: var(--stone);
    margin: 0;
  }
  .intro-list {
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px;
    margin-top: 4px;
  }
  .intro-list p {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: clamp(17px, 1.55vw, 21px);
    font-weight: 300; font-style: italic;
    line-height: 1.6; color: var(--stone);
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 14px;
    position: relative;
  }
  .intro-list p::before {
    content: '—';
    position: absolute; left: 0;
    color: var(--rose); font-size: 11px;
  }

  /* ── Outer wrap ── */
  .outer-wrap {
    max-width: 1600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 clamp(20px, 5vw, 80px) 100px;
  }

  /* ── Shared module label ── */
  .mod-label {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 10px; font-weight: 300;
    letter-spacing: 0.22em; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--stone);
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .mod-label::before {
    content: '';
    display: inline-block;
    width: 20px; height: 1px;
    background: var(--rose); flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  /* ── Bento grid ── */
  .bento {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(12, 1fr);
    grid-template-rows: auto auto auto;
    gap: 14px;
    margin-top: 64px;
    padding-top: 32px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }
  .bento-card {
    background: #f7f5f2;
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 28px;
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    min-width: 0;
  }

  /* Column spans */
  .bento-music   { grid-column: span 12; }
  .bento-cats    { grid-column: span 12; }

  /* ── Sound (Music) ── */
  .sound-body {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 5fr) minmax(0, 6fr);
    gap: 28px clamp(32px, 4vw, 56px);
    align-items: center;
  }
  .sound-text { min-width: 0; }
  .sound-p {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: clamp(17px, 1.45vw, 20px);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.85;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin: 0 0 12px;
  }
  .sound-p:last-of-type { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .sound-photos { margin: 0; min-width: 0; }
  /* column widths match the photos' aspect ratios (400×600, 450×600) so both render at the same height */
  .pipa-photos {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 400fr 450fr;
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .pipa-photo {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: 8px;
    display: block;
  }
  .pipa-caption {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--stone);
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    margin-top: 10px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .instrument-list {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    display: flex;
    gap: 0;
    margin-top: 4px;
    padding-top: 18px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }
  .instrument-item {
    flex: 1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: row;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 12px;
    padding-right: 16px;
    border-right: 1px solid var(--rule);
    margin-right: 16px;
  }
  .instr-text {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
  }
  .instrument-item:last-child { border-right: none; margin-right: 0; padding-right: 0; }
  .instr-img {
    height: 130px;
    width: auto;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    opacity: 0.9;
  }
  .instr-zh {
    font-family: 'Ma Shan Zheng', var(--serif);
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--ink);
    line-height: 1.2;
  }
  .instr-en {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--ink);
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }
  .instr-note {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--stone);
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  /* ── Cats ── */
  .cats-wrap {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }
  /* alternating rows: photo | text, then text | photo */
  .cat-card {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 2fr) minmax(0, 3fr);
    gap: clamp(28px, 4vw, 56px);
    align-items: start;
  }
  .cat-card--reverse { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 3fr) minmax(0, 2fr); }
  .cat-card--reverse .cat-photo-wrap { order: 2; }
  .cats-divider {
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--rule);
    margin: clamp(28px, 3vw, 40px) 0;
  }
  .cat-photo-wrap {
    width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 4/3;
    border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden;
  }
  .cat-photo {
    width: 100%; height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover; display: block;
  }
  .cat-info { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; }
  .cat-meta { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
  .cat-gender { font-family: var(--sans); font-size: 18px; color: var(--rose); }
  .cat-since {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 10px; font-weight: 300;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--stone);
  }
  .cat-name {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: clamp(22px, 2.2vw, 28px);
    font-weight: 400; font-style: italic;
    color: var(--ink); line-height: 1.2;
  }
  .cat-name-en {
    font-size: 0.75em;
    color: var(--stone);
  }
  .cat-story { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }
  .cat-story p {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: clamp(17px, 1.45vw, 20px);
    font-weight: 300; font-style: italic;
    line-height: 1.75; color: var(--ink); margin: 0;
  }

  /* ── Easter egg ── */
  .egg-wrap {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 48px 0 80px;
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .egg-trigger {
    background: none; border: none; cursor: pointer;
    font-family: var(--sans); font-size: 13px;
    letter-spacing: 0.3em;
    color: #c8c2bc;
    padding: 4px 8px;
    transition: color 0.3s;
  }
  .egg-trigger:hover { color: var(--stone); }
  .egg-box {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: clamp(14px, 1.2vw, 16px);
    font-weight: 300; font-style: italic;
    color: var(--stone);
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 480px;
    line-height: 1.75;
    animation: eggFade 0.35s ease;
  }
  @keyframes eggFade {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-6px); }
    to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  }
  .egg-label {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 9px; font-weight: 300;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--rose);
    margin-right: 8px;
    font-style: normal;
  }

  /* ── Hike CTA ── */
  .hike-cta {
    display: block;
    position: relative;
    margin-top: 52px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .hike-cta-bg {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    transition: transform 0.7s ease;
  }
  .hike-cta:hover .hike-cta-bg { transform: scale(1.04); }
  .bento > .hike-cta { grid-column: 1 / -1; margin-top: 0; }

  /* bottom-up gradient overlay */
  .hike-cta::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(
      to top,
      rgba(8, 6, 4, 0.72) 0%,
      rgba(8, 6, 4, 0.22) 48%,
      transparent 72%
    );
  }
  .hike-cta-content {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    padding: 40px 48px;
    gap: 18px;
  }
  .hike-cta-title {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: clamp(30px, 3.8vw, 54px);
    font-weight: 300; font-style: italic;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.96);
    line-height: 1.1;
    text-shadow: 0 2px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.25);
    margin: 0;
  }
  .hike-cta-btn {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 9px 22px;
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 11px; font-weight: 300;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.92);
    border: 1.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.55);
    border-radius: 6px;
    width: fit-content;
    transition: border-color 0.22s, background 0.22s, color 0.22s;
  }
  .hike-cta:hover .hike-cta-btn {
    border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.9);
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    color: white;
  }

  @media (max-width: 680px) {
    .hike-cta { height: 340px; }
    .hike-cta-bg { height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }
    .hike-cta-content { padding: 28px 28px; gap: 14px; }
  }

  /* ── Tablet landscape: hero ── */
  @media (min-width: 821px) and (max-width: 1180px) {
    .hero-wrap { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 2fr) minmax(0, 3fr); gap: 40px; }
    .hero-photo-col { width: 100%; }
  }

  /* ── Mobile: hero ── */
  @media (max-width: 820px) {
    .hero-wrap {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 28px;
      padding-top: 40px;
    }
    .hero-photo-col {
      width: 100%;
      min-height: 0;
      aspect-ratio: unset;
      border-radius: 12px;
      overflow: hidden;
      -webkit-mask-image: none;
      mask-image: none;
    }
    .hero-photo {
      height: auto;
      max-height: 560px;
      object-fit: cover;
      object-position: 75% 40%;
    }


    .instrument-list { flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 16px 12px; }
    .instrument-item {
      flex: 1 1 calc(50% - 6px);
      min-width: 0;
      border-right: none;
      margin-right: 0;
      padding-right: 0;
    }
    .instr-img { height: 90px; }
  }

  /* ── Tablet: music text and photos stack (side by side the text column gets too narrow) ── */
  @media (max-width: 1100px) {
    .sound-body { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); }
    .sound-photos { max-width: 560px; width: 100%; justify-self: center; }
  }

  /* ── Tablet portrait: bento ── */
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .bento-music, .bento-cats { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
  }

  /* ── Mobile: bento ── */
  @media (max-width: 680px) {
    .cat-card, .cat-card--reverse { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 20px; }
    .cat-card--reverse .cat-photo-wrap { order: 0; }

    .bento { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 10px; }
    .bento-music   { grid-column: span 2; }
    .bento-cats    { grid-column: span 2; }


  }

  @media (max-width: 420px) {
    .bento { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .bento-music, .bento-cats {
      grid-column: span 1;
    }
  }
</style>

<script is:inline>
// Easter egg toggle
const eggBtn = document.getElementById('egg-btn');
const eggBox = document.getElementById('egg-box');
if (eggBtn && eggBox) {
  eggBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
    const visible = eggBox.style.display !== 'none';
    eggBox.style.display = visible ? 'none' : 'block';
    eggBox.setAttribute('aria-hidden', String(visible));
  });
}


</script>
